WEBVTT

00:09.443 --> 00:10.844
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.911 --> 00:12.746
Kids:
AYE AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是啊是，队长！

00:12.813 --> 00:14.115
I CAN'T HEAR YOU!
我听不到你说话！

00:14.182 --> 00:15.849
AYE AYE, CAPTAIN!
是啊是，队长！

00:15.916 --> 00:18.386
* OH... *
* 哦... *

00:18.452 --> 00:20.988
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:21.055 --> 00:22.990
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:23.057 --> 00:24.558
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:24.625 --> 00:26.227
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.294 --> 00:29.063
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH *
*如果航海废话
成为您所希望的*

00:29.130 --> 00:30.564
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.631 --> 00:33.033
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑腾*

00:33.101 --> 00:34.968
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:35.035 --> 00:36.904
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.970 --> 00:38.972
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS *
*海绵宝宝*

00:39.039 --> 00:40.941
* SPONGEBOB
SQUAREPANTS *
* 海绵宝宝
方裤 *

00:41.008 --> 00:44.612
* SPONGEBOB... SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝...方裤！ *

00:44.678 --> 00:46.980
( Captain laughs )
（队长笑）

00:47.047 --> 00:49.217
( plays flute tune )
（吹奏长笛曲调）

00:49.283 --> 00:54.688
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部

00:54.755 --> 00:59.727
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:04.598 --> 01:09.002
Frenchman:
AH, THE SEA, SO FASCINATING,
SO WONDERFUL.
法国人：
啊，大海，如此迷人，
太棒了。

01:09.137 --> 01:12.240
HERE WE SEE BIKINI BOTTOM,
TEEMING WITH LIFE
在这里我们看到比基尼底部，
充满生机

01:12.306 --> 01:15.008
HOME OF ONE OF
MY FAVORITE CREATURES:
其中一位的家
我最喜欢的生物：

01:15.143 --> 01:16.944
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
海绵宝宝。

01:17.010 --> 01:20.381
YES, OF COURSE HE LIVES
IN A PINEAPPLE, YOU SILLY.
是的，他当然还活着
在菠萝里，你这个傻瓜。

01:20.448 --> 01:25.219
( snoring )
（打鼾）

01:25.286 --> 01:26.820
( horn blows )
（号角吹响）

01:34.162 --> 01:35.163
( horn stops )
（喇叭停止）

01:36.164 --> 01:37.798
TODAY'S THE BIG DAY, GARY.
今天是个大日子，加里。

01:37.865 --> 01:39.467
( meows )
（喵）

01:39.533 --> 01:40.701
LOOK AT ME!
看着我！

01:40.768 --> 01:43.637
I'M... NAKED!
我……赤身裸体！

01:46.474 --> 01:49.810
GOT TO BE IN TOP PHYSICAL
CONDITION FOR TODAY, GARY.
必须保持最佳体能
今天的情况，加里。

01:49.877 --> 01:51.379
( meows )
（喵）

01:51.445 --> 01:55.283
( breathing deeply )
（深呼吸）

01:55.349 --> 01:56.450
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

01:56.517 --> 01:57.518
( screams )
（尖叫声）

01:59.220 --> 02:00.688
( grunts and screams )
（咕哝声和尖叫声）

02:00.754 --> 02:02.523
( pants )
（ 裤子 ）

02:05.759 --> 02:08.529
( screams  )
（尖叫声）

02:08.596 --> 02:11.732
( gasps )
（喘气）

02:11.799 --> 02:13.434
( bunnies squeak )
（兔子吱吱声）

02:13.501 --> 02:16.069
SpongeBob:
I'M READY!
海绵宝宝：
我准备好了！

02:16.204 --> 02:19.039
I'M READY, I'M READY, I'M READY.
我准备好了，我准备好了，我准备好了。

02:19.106 --> 02:23.277
I'M READY, I'M READY, I'M READY,
I'M READY...
我准备好了，我准备好了，我准备好了，
我准备好了...

02:23.344 --> 02:24.878
GO, SPONGEBOB!
去吧，海绵宝宝！

02:24.945 --> 02:26.214
WHOA...
哇...

02:26.214 --> 02:27.281
( crashes )
（崩溃）

02:28.449 --> 02:29.550
THERE IT IS...
就在那里……

02:29.617 --> 02:31.885
THE FINEST EATING ESTABLISHMENT
最好的餐饮场所

02:31.952 --> 02:34.054
EVER ESTABLISHED FOR EATING.
曾经为食用而设立。

02:34.121 --> 02:37.124
THE KRUSTY KRAB,
HOME OF THE CRABBY PATTY.
脆皮蟹，
蟹肉饼之家。

02:37.225 --> 02:39.360
A HELP WANTED SIGN
IN THE WINDOW.
需要帮助的标志
在窗户里。

02:39.427 --> 02:41.962
FOR YEARS, I'VE DREAMED
OF THIS MOMENT.
多年来，我一直梦想着
这一刻。

02:42.029 --> 02:45.699
I'M GOING TO GO IN THERE,
MARCH STRAIGHT TO THE MANAGER
我要去那里，
直接向经理进军

02:45.766 --> 02:48.336
LOOK HIM IN THE EYE,
LAY IT ON THE LINE
看着他的眼睛，
上线

02:48.402 --> 02:49.803
AND I CAN'T DO THIS!
我不能这样做！

02:49.870 --> 02:50.904
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

02:50.971 --> 02:52.973
WHERE DO YOU THINK
YOU'RE GOING?
你认为在哪里
你要去吗？

02:53.040 --> 02:54.908
I WAS JUST...
NO, YOU'RE NOT.
我只是...
不，你不是。

02:54.975 --> 02:58.746
YOU'RE GOING TO
THE KRUSTY KRAB
AND GET THAT JOB!
你将会
脆皮蟹
得到那份工作！

02:58.812 --> 03:00.614
I CAN'T,
DON'T YOU SEE?
我不能，
你不明白吗？

03:00.681 --> 03:01.949
I'M NOT GOOD ENOUGH.
我还不够好。

03:02.015 --> 03:04.885
WHOSE FIRST WORDS WERE,
"MAY I TAKE YOUR ORDER?"
谁的第一句话是，
“我可以接受您的订单吗？”

03:04.952 --> 03:05.619
MINE WERE.
我的是。

03:05.686 --> 03:06.887
WHO MADE A SPATULA
谁制作了抹刀

03:06.954 --> 03:09.257
OUT OF TOOTHPICKS
IN WOOD SHOP?
牙签用完
在木工店？

03:09.323 --> 03:10.258
I DID.
我做到了。

03:10.324 --> 03:11.259
WHO'S...
谁的...

03:11.325 --> 03:12.393
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

03:12.460 --> 03:13.461
WHO'S...
谁的...

03:15.263 --> 03:17.465
WHO'S A BIG,
YELLOW CUBE WITH HOLES?
谁很大，
带孔的黄色立方体？

03:17.531 --> 03:18.366
I AM!
我是！

03:18.432 --> 03:19.367
WHO'S READY?
谁准备好了吗？

03:19.433 --> 03:20.368
I'M READY!
我准备好了！

03:20.434 --> 03:22.303
WHO'S READY?
I'M READY!
谁准备好了吗？
我准备好了！

03:22.370 --> 03:23.304
WHO'S READY?
谁准备好了吗？

03:23.371 --> 03:24.372
I'M READY!
我准备好了！

03:24.438 --> 03:25.739
I'M READY.
我准备好了。

03:25.806 --> 03:27.408
I'M READY, I'M READY...
我准备好了，我准备好了……

03:30.077 --> 03:32.980
I'M READY, I'M READY,
I'M READY!
我准备好了，我准备好了，
我准备好了！

03:33.046 --> 03:33.981
OH, NO. SPONGEBOB!
哦，不。海绵宝宝！

03:34.047 --> 03:35.949
WHAT COULD HE POSSIBLY WANT?
他可能想要什么？

03:36.016 --> 03:38.051
GO, SPONGEBOB!
GO, SPONGEBOB!
去吧，海绵宝宝！
去吧，海绵宝宝！

03:38.118 --> 03:40.153
GO, SPONGEBOB,
GO, SELF.
去吧，海绵宝宝，
去吧，自我。

03:40.288 --> 03:41.289
( shrieks )
（尖叫声）

03:41.289 --> 03:42.390
MR. KRABS!
先生。螃蟹！

03:42.456 --> 03:44.992
HURRY, MR. KRABS,
BEFORE IT'S TOO LATE.
快点，先生。螃蟹，
在为时已晚之前。

03:45.058 --> 03:48.028
SpongeBob:
PERMISSION TO COME ABOARD,
CAPTAIN.
海绵宝宝：
上船许可，
船长。

03:48.095 --> 03:50.431
I'VE BEEN TRAINING MY WHOLE LIFE
我一生都在训练

03:50.498 --> 03:53.967
TO JOIN THE KRUSTY CREW,
AND NOW I'M READY.
加入 Krusty 团队，
现在我准备好了。

03:54.034 --> 03:59.440
( yelping )
（尖叫）

03:59.507 --> 04:02.209
( bouncing and yelping )
（弹跳和叫喊）

04:07.080 --> 04:09.016
AH!
啊！

04:09.082 --> 04:10.318
AH! OOH.
啊！哦。

04:10.318 --> 04:11.852
UM...
嗯...

04:11.919 --> 04:13.821
SO, UH, WHEN DO I START?
那么，呃，我什么时候开始？

04:13.887 --> 04:17.325
LAD, IT LOOKS LIKE YOU DON'T
EVEN HAVE YOUR SEA LEGS.
小伙子，看起来你不这么认为
甚至拥有您的海上腿。

04:17.325 --> 04:20.628
MR. KRABS, PLEASE, I'LL PROVE
I'M FRY COOK MATERIAL.
先生。蟹蟹，拜托，我会证明的
我是炒菜材料。

04:20.694 --> 04:21.629
ASK SQUIDWARD.
问问章鱼哥。

04:21.695 --> 04:23.030
HE'LL VOUCH FOR ME.
他会为我担保。

04:24.898 --> 04:25.899
NO.
不。

04:28.402 --> 04:31.539
WELL, LAD, WE'LL GIVE YOU
A TEST, AND IF YOU PASS
好吧，小伙子，我们会给你
测试，如果你通过了

04:31.605 --> 04:34.475
YOU'LL BE
ON THE KRUSTY CREW.
你会的
关于 Krusty 船员。

04:34.542 --> 04:36.910
GO OUT AND FETCH ME A...
出去给我拿一个……

04:36.977 --> 04:41.349
A... HYDRODYNAMIC SPATULA
A...流体动力抹刀

04:41.382 --> 04:44.017
WITH, UM, PORT AND
STARBOARD ATTACHMENTS
与，嗯，端口和
右舷附件

04:44.084 --> 04:45.653
AND TURBO DRIVE.
和涡轮驱动。

04:45.719 --> 04:48.356
AND DON'T COME BACK
TILL YOU GET ONE.
并且不要回来
直到你得到一个。

04:50.023 --> 04:51.158
AYE AYE, CAPTAIN.
是啊是，队长。

04:51.224 --> 04:52.426
ONE HYDRODYNAMIC
SPATULA
一流体动力
锅铲

04:52.493 --> 04:55.162
PORT AND STARBOARD
ATTACHMENTS,
TURBO DRIVE
左舷和右舷
附件，
涡轮驱动

04:55.228 --> 04:56.163
COMING UP, SIR!
即将到来，先生！

04:56.229 --> 04:57.230
CARRY ON!
继续！

04:57.365 --> 04:59.667
WE'LL NEVER SEE
THAT LUBBER AGAIN.
我们永远不会看到
又是那个润滑液。

04:59.733 --> 05:01.268
YOU'RE TERRIBLE.
你太糟糕了。

05:01.369 --> 05:03.270
A HYDRO WHAT?
水力发电什么？

05:03.371 --> 05:06.707
( laughing )
（笑）

05:06.774 --> 05:10.378
( still laughing... )
（还在笑……）

05:10.444 --> 05:14.114
Driver:
HEY, HEY, PLEASE!
PASSENGERS ARE TO STAY SEATED
司机：
嘿，嘿，拜托！
乘客应留在座位上

05:14.181 --> 05:16.717
AND NOT PUT THEIR HEADS
OUT THE WINDOWS.
不要把头伸过来
窗外。

05:16.784 --> 05:20.721
( laughter inside continues )
（里面的笑声还在继续）

05:20.788 --> 05:22.089
( gasps )
（喘气）

05:22.155 --> 05:24.057
THAT SOUNDED
LIKE HATCH DOORS.
听起来不错
像舱门。

05:24.124 --> 05:27.628
( sniffing )
（嗅）

05:27.695 --> 05:28.729
DO YOU SMELL IT?
你闻到了吗？

05:28.796 --> 05:30.898
THAT SMELL.
那种味道。

05:30.964 --> 05:33.401
A KIND OF SMELLY SMELL.
一种臭味。

05:33.434 --> 05:36.770
A SMELLY SMELL THAT SMELLS...
一股臭味，闻起来……

05:36.837 --> 05:38.138
SMELLY.
臭。

05:38.205 --> 05:40.874
ANCHOVIES.
凤尾鱼。

05:40.941 --> 05:42.576
WHAT?
什么？

05:42.643 --> 05:44.612
ANCHOVIES!
凤尾鱼！

05:44.678 --> 05:51.785
( anchovies clamoring )
（凤尾鱼叫嚷）

05:51.852 --> 05:53.253
PLEASE, PLEASE!
拜托，拜托！

05:53.320 --> 05:55.222
QUIET!
安静的！

05:55.288 --> 05:57.190
IS THIS ANY WAY
TO BEHAVE?
这是什么办法吗？
行为举止？

05:57.257 --> 05:58.759
HMM?
唔？

05:58.826 --> 06:01.061
CAN WE SHOW
A LITTLE DECENCY
我们可以展示吗
一点点正派

06:01.128 --> 06:05.599
AND FORM A NEAT, SINGLE-FILE
LINE IN FRONT OF THE REGISTER?
并形成整齐的单行
寄存器前面有一行吗？

06:07.000 --> 06:09.002
( clamoring hysterically )
（歇斯底里地叫喊）

06:09.069 --> 06:12.606
* BARG'N-MART, MEETING
ALL YOUR SPATULA NEEDS. *
* BARG'N-MART，会议
满足您所有抹刀需求。 *

06:12.673 --> 06:14.341
Krabs:
ALL HANDS ON DECK!
螃蟹：
全体人员齐心协力！

06:14.442 --> 06:15.876
GET YOUR ANCHORS
OUT OF YOUR PANTS!
获得你的锚点
脱光你的裤子！

06:15.943 --> 06:20.448
ONE SINGLE-FILE LINE
IS ALL I ASK!
WHOA!
一根单列线
这就是我所要求的！
哇啊！

06:20.481 --> 06:22.249
WHOA!
哇啊！

06:22.315 --> 06:24.885
BATTEN DOWN THE HATCHES,
MR. SQUIDWARD!
压紧舱门，
先生。章鱼哥！

06:24.952 --> 06:27.555
WE'RE TAKING ON WATER,
MR. SQUIDWARD!
我们正在取水，
先生。章鱼哥！

06:27.621 --> 06:30.257
I WANT MY MOMMY,
MR. SQUIDWARD!
我想要我的妈妈，
先生。章鱼哥！

06:30.323 --> 06:32.125
( humming )
（嗡嗡声）

06:32.192 --> 06:33.494
* SPATULA, SPATULA *
* 抹刀，抹刀 *

06:33.561 --> 06:35.763
* PORT AND STARBOARD
ATTACHMENTS. *
* 左舷和右舷
附件。 *

06:35.829 --> 06:37.765
Squidward:
HELP!
章鱼哥：
救命！

06:37.831 --> 06:40.601
Krabs:
MAN OVERBOARD!
螃蟹：
男子落水！

06:40.668 --> 06:42.570
CLIMB, MR. SQUIDWARD,
CLIMB!
克莱姆先生。章鱼哥，
爬！

06:48.542 --> 06:50.243
THIS IS THE END!
这就是结局！

06:50.310 --> 06:52.145
GOOD-BYE,
MR. SQUIDWARD.
再见，
先生。章鱼哥。

06:52.212 --> 06:53.747
OH, MR. KRABS!
哦，先生。螃蟹！

06:53.814 --> 06:56.183
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

06:56.249 --> 06:59.186
SpongeBob:
PERMISSION TO COME ABOARD,
CAPTAIN.
海绵宝宝：
上船许可，
船长。

06:59.252 --> 07:04.124
* DA-DADADA-DA-DAH! *
* 哒哒哒哒哒哒！ *

07:04.191 --> 07:06.694
DID SOMEONE
ORDER A SPATULA?
有人吗
订购抹刀？

07:06.760 --> 07:09.262
( babbling
incoherently )
（胡言乱语
语无伦次）

07:09.329 --> 07:11.765
THAT'S RIGHT,
ONE HYDRODYNAMIC SPATULA
没错，
一把流体动力抹刀

07:11.832 --> 07:14.134
WITH PORT
AND STARBOARD
ATTACHMENTS
带端口
和右舷
附件

07:14.201 --> 07:17.204
AND LET'S NOT FORGET
THE TURBO DRIVE.
我们不要忘记
涡轮驱动。

07:17.270 --> 07:20.073
WOULD YOU BELIEVE
THEY ONLY HAD
ONE IN STOCK?
你相信吗
他们只有
有现货吗？

07:20.140 --> 07:21.942
TO THE KITCHEN!
到厨房！

07:22.009 --> 07:24.612
WHO'S HUNGRY?
谁饿了？

07:24.678 --> 07:26.647
( anchovies clamor )
（凤尾鱼叫嚣）

07:26.714 --> 07:28.682
Tiny Tim:
* THINGS THAT BOTHER YOU
NEVER BOTHER ME *
小蒂姆：
* 困扰你的事情
永远不要打扰我*

07:28.749 --> 07:30.651
* I'M AS HAPPY AS PIE, HA-HA! *
* 我高兴极了，哈哈！ *

07:30.718 --> 07:33.053
* LIVING IN THE SUNLIGHT,
LOVING IN THE MOONLIGHT *
* 生活在阳光下，
月光下的爱*

07:33.120 --> 07:35.288
* HAVING A WONDERFUL TIME. *
* 度过了一段美好的时光。 *

07:35.355 --> 07:37.858
* HAVEN'T GOT A LOT,
I DON'T NEED A LOT *
* 还没有很多，
我不需要很多 *

07:37.925 --> 07:39.660
* COFFEE'S ONLY A DIME *
* 咖啡只要一毛钱 *

07:39.727 --> 07:42.563
* LIVING IN THE SUNLIGHT,
LOVING IN THE MOONLIGHT *
* 生活在阳光下，
月光下的爱*

07:42.630 --> 07:44.865
* HAVING A WONDERFUL TIME. *
* 度过了一段美好的时光。 *

07:44.932 --> 07:49.436
* JUST TAKE IT FROM ME,
I'M JUST AS FREE
AS ANY BROTHER. *
* 就从我这里拿走吧，
我一样自由
和任何兄弟一样。 *

07:49.537 --> 07:54.642
* I DO WHAT I LIKE
JUST WHEN I LIKE,
AND HOW I LOVE IT. *
* 我做我喜欢做的事
就在我喜欢的时候，
我多么喜欢它。 *

07:59.547 --> 08:02.182
* I'M RIGHT HERE TO STAY,
WHEN I'M OLD AND GRAY *
*我就留在这里，
当我老了、头发花白的时候*

08:02.249 --> 08:04.652
* I'LL BE RIGHT IN MY PRIME *
*我将正值巅峰*

08:04.718 --> 08:07.621
* LIVING IN THE SUNLIGHT,
LOVING IN THE MOONLIGHT *
* 生活在阳光下，
月光下的爱*

08:07.688 --> 08:10.190
* HAVING A WONDERFUL TIME. *
* 度过了一段美好的时光。 *

08:10.257 --> 08:17.898
( trilling the tune )
（颤音）

08:19.567 --> 08:21.134
( blows a musical note )
（吹响一个音符）

08:22.335 --> 08:24.705
THAT WAS THE FINEST
FAST-FOODSMANSHIP
那是最好的
快餐精神

08:24.772 --> 08:26.807
I'VE EVER SEEN,
MR. SQUAREPANTS.
I'VE EVER SEEN,
先生。 SQUAREPANTS.

08:26.874 --> 08:28.108
WELCOME ABOARD.
欢迎登机。

08:28.175 --> 08:29.109
BUT MR. KRABS...
但是先生。螃蟹...

08:29.176 --> 08:31.011
THREE CHEERS
FOR SPONGEBOB!
三声欢呼
为了海绵宝宝！

08:31.078 --> 08:32.012
HIP, HIP...
髋关节，髋关节...

08:32.079 --> 08:33.013
HOORAY.
MR. KRABS...
万岁。
先生。螃蟹...

08:33.080 --> 08:34.014
HIP, HIP...
HOORAY.
髋关节，髋关节...
万岁。

08:34.081 --> 08:35.015
HIP, HIP...
髋关节，髋关节...

08:35.082 --> 08:36.283
HOORAY. MR. KRABS...
万岁。先生。螃蟹...

08:36.349 --> 08:37.851
I'LL BE
IN MY QUARTERS
我会的
在我的宿舍里

08:37.918 --> 08:39.452
COUNTING UP THE BOOTY.
数着战利品。

08:41.388 --> 08:43.857
GOOD MORNING, KRUSTY CREW!
早上好，Krusty 船员！

08:43.924 --> 08:46.894
WHAT WOULD YOU LIKE
TO ORDER, PATRICK?
你想要什么
要订购吗，帕特里克？

08:46.960 --> 08:49.462
ONE CRABBY
PATTY, PLEASE.
一只螃蟹
帕蒂，请。

08:51.031 --> 08:52.432
( crashing )
（崩溃）

08:54.134 --> 08:56.604
Squidward:
MR. KRABS, MR. KRABS!
章鱼哥：
先生。克拉布斯先生。螃蟹！

08:56.670 --> 08:59.773
MR. KRABS, COME SEE
YOUR NEW EMPLOYEE.
先生。蟹蟹，快来看看
您的新员工。

08:59.840 --> 09:03.176
* LIVING IN THE SUNLIGHT,
LOVING IN THE MOONLIGHT *
* 生活在阳光下，
月光下的爱*

09:03.243 --> 09:05.445
* HAVING A WONDERFUL TIME! *
* 玩得很开心！ *

09:31.438 --> 09:33.140
( whistles casually )
（随意吹口哨）

09:51.759 --> 09:53.393
( motor throbbing... )
（电机颤动……）

09:56.864 --> 09:58.365
( grumbles )
（抱怨）

11:01.228 --> 11:03.063
( coughs )
（咳嗽）

11:05.432 --> 11:07.600
( motor starts,
then dies )
（电机启动，
然后死了）

11:33.894 --> 11:35.095
( gasps )
（喘气）

12:14.167 --> 12:17.170
( buzzing like a bee )
（像蜜蜂一样嗡嗡作响）

12:22.609 --> 12:25.212
WOW, FOUR STINGERS.
哇，四个毒刺。

12:27.314 --> 12:30.217
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

12:37.257 --> 12:38.591
OH!
哦！

12:38.658 --> 12:40.994
( girl yelling )
（女孩大喊）

12:41.061 --> 12:43.130
( yelling )
（大喊）

12:50.070 --> 12:51.271
( gasps )
（喘气）

12:51.338 --> 12:53.406
( grunting... )
（咕哝……）

12:56.209 --> 12:58.711
WHERE HAVE I SEEN THIS BEFORE?
我以前在哪里见过这个？

13:02.182 --> 13:03.416
HERE IT IS--
这里是 -

13:03.483 --> 13:05.118
LAND SQUIRREL.
陆松鼠。

13:05.185 --> 13:07.054
THAT LITTLE SQUIRREL
IS IN TROUBLE.
那只小松鼠
有麻烦了。

13:07.120 --> 13:10.223
TAKE THAT, YOU SORRY OLD CLAM.
拿着这个，你这个对不起的老蛤。

13:10.290 --> 13:13.861
YOU NEED TO LEARN SOME MANNERS.
你需要学习一些礼仪。

13:13.861 --> 13:16.396
YOU'RE ABOUT AS UGLY
AS HOMEMADE SOUP.
你也同样丑陋
作为自制汤。

13:16.463 --> 13:17.998
HOORAY, LAND SQUIRREL!
万岁，地松鼠！

13:18.065 --> 13:19.900
( growls )
（咆哮）

13:21.634 --> 13:22.870
LOOK OUT!
当心！

13:22.936 --> 13:24.471
( grunting... )
（咕哝……）

13:24.537 --> 13:26.339
HOLD ON, LITTLE SQUIRREL!
坚持住，小松鼠！

13:26.406 --> 13:28.008
( karate yell )
（空手道大喊）

13:28.708 --> 13:29.877
HO-HO-HO-HO!
嗬-嗬-嗬-嗬！

13:29.910 --> 13:31.278
HO-HEE!
呵呵！

13:31.344 --> 13:33.380
HOY-YA!
嘿呀！

13:33.446 --> 13:35.448
YOU HAVE FOUGHT WELL,
GIANT CLAM.
你打得很好，
巨蛤。

13:35.515 --> 13:37.017
PREPARE TO BE VANQUISHED.
准备好被征服吧。

13:37.084 --> 13:38.551
( yells, grunting... )
（喊叫、咕噜声……）

13:41.088 --> 13:43.523
HEY, I'M ACTUALLY DOING IT.
嘿，我真的在做。

13:43.590 --> 13:44.892
( grunting... )
（咕哝……）

13:44.958 --> 13:46.226
( victorious yell )
（胜利的呐喊）

13:49.963 --> 13:52.065
YOUR SHELL IS MINE!
你的壳是我的！

14:02.309 --> 14:05.612
( grunts )
HOLD ON THERE,
LITTLE SQUARE DUDE.
（咕哝声）
坚持住，
小方块家伙。

14:05.678 --> 14:07.014
( karate yell )
（空手道大喊）

14:09.016 --> 14:11.351
( yells )
（大喊）

14:12.652 --> 14:14.287
( clam whimpers )
（蛤蜊呜咽声）

14:16.423 --> 14:18.591
HEY, YOU LIKE
KARATE, TOO.
嘿，你喜欢
空手道也是如此。

14:18.658 --> 14:20.193
( karate yelling... )
（空手道大喊……）

14:22.329 --> 14:23.696
HA!
哈！

14:23.763 --> 14:25.565
SO, WHAT'S YOUR NAME?
那么，你叫什么名字？

14:25.632 --> 14:27.000
SANDY.
沙。

14:27.067 --> 14:32.272
SO, WHAT... DO... YOU...
CALL YOURSELF?
那么，你...做什么...
给自己打电话？

14:32.339 --> 14:35.242
( yelling ):
I'M SPONGEBOB!
（大喊）：
我是海绵宝宝！

14:38.145 --> 14:39.947
WELL, SPONGEBOB...
嗯，海绵宝宝...

14:40.013 --> 14:42.249
TAKE A GANDER AT THIS.
看看这个。

14:47.587 --> 14:50.490
( rumbling, cracking... )
（隆隆声、破裂声……）

14:55.328 --> 14:56.363
OH.
哦。

14:57.998 --> 14:59.032
OH, YEAH?
哦，是吗？

14:59.099 --> 15:00.167
WATCH THIS.
注意这个。

15:00.233 --> 15:01.634
( yells )
（大喊）

15:01.701 --> 15:02.869
( armpit-farts )
（腋下放屁）

15:04.137 --> 15:06.406
( giggles )
I LIKE YOU, SPONGEBOB.
（咯咯笑）
我喜欢你，海绵宝宝。

15:06.473 --> 15:09.009
WE COULD BE TIGHTER
THAN BARK ON A TREE.
我们可以更紧一些
比树上的树皮。

15:09.076 --> 15:09.977
( karate yells )
（空手道大喊）

15:11.711 --> 15:14.847
UH, I LIKE YOU
TOO, SANDY.
呃，我喜欢你
还有，桑迪。

15:14.982 --> 15:16.283
( karate yells )
（空手道大喊）

15:17.217 --> 15:19.219
WHAT IS THAT ON YOUR HEAD?
你头上的是什么？

15:19.286 --> 15:20.753
THAT'S MY AIR HELMET.
这是我的空气头盔。

15:20.820 --> 15:22.022
MAY I TRY IT ON?
我可以试穿吗？

15:22.089 --> 15:24.024
HECK NO,
I NEED IT TO BREATHE.
哎呀不，
我需要它来呼吸。

15:24.091 --> 15:25.492
I GOT TO HAVE MY AIR.
我必须呼吸空气。

15:25.558 --> 15:26.994
ME, TOO!
我也是！

15:27.027 --> 15:27.995
I LOVE AIR.
我喜欢空气。

15:28.061 --> 15:28.996
AIR IS GOOD.
空气很好。

15:29.062 --> 15:30.097
NO KIDDING?
别开玩笑了？

15:30.163 --> 15:31.898
WHY, AIR IS MY MIDDLE NAME.
为什么，空气是我的中间名。

15:31.999 --> 15:33.600
THE MORE AIR, THE BETTER.
空气越多越好。

15:33.666 --> 15:35.035
CAN'T GET ENOUGH AIR.
无法获得足够的空气。

15:35.102 --> 15:36.536
( drawling ):
SHOOT!
（画画）：
射击！

15:36.603 --> 15:40.273
HOW ABOUT COMING OVER TOMORROW
FOR TEA AND COOKIES THEN?
明天过来怎么样
那么茶和饼干呢？

15:41.508 --> 15:43.010
DON'T BE LATE.
不要迟到。

15:43.043 --> 15:44.711
OKAY, SEE YOU TOMORROW.
好的，明天见。

15:44.777 --> 15:46.046
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

15:46.113 --> 15:47.280
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

15:47.347 --> 15:49.316
PATRICK, PATRICK, PATRICK!
帕特里克，帕特里克，帕特里克！

15:49.382 --> 15:50.917
WHAT'S AIR?
什么是空气？

15:51.018 --> 15:52.052
HUH?
嗯？

15:52.119 --> 15:53.653
I JUST MET THIS GIRL.
我刚刚认识这个女孩。

15:53.720 --> 15:56.389
SHE WEARS A HAT FULL OF... AIR.
她戴着一顶充满……空气的帽子。

15:56.456 --> 16:00.160
DO YOU MEAN SHE "PUTS ON AIRS"?
你的意思是她“装腔作势”吗？

16:00.227 --> 16:01.261
I GUESS SO.
大概吧。

16:01.328 --> 16:03.696
THAT'S JUST FANCY TALK.
这只是空谈。

16:03.763 --> 16:05.365
IF YOU WANT TO BE FANCY
如果你想变得漂亮

16:05.432 --> 16:07.567
HOLD YOUR PINKY UP LIKE THIS.
像这样举起你的小指。

16:07.634 --> 16:10.903
THE HIGHER YOU HOLD IT,
THE FANCIER YOU ARE.
你握得越高，
你就是这样的鸽友。

16:11.038 --> 16:12.172
HOW'S THAT?
怎么样？

16:12.239 --> 16:13.173
HIGHER.
更高。

16:13.240 --> 16:14.174
LIKE THAT?
喜欢这样吗？

16:14.241 --> 16:15.675
NOW, THAT'S FANCY!
现在，太棒了！

16:15.742 --> 16:19.179
THEY SHOULD CALL YOU
SPONGEBOB FANCYPANTS.
他们应该给你打电话
海绵宝宝花式裤。

16:21.148 --> 16:24.951
REMEMBER, WHEN IN DOUBT,
PINKY OUT.
请记住，当有疑问时，
小指出来了。

16:25.052 --> 16:27.187
YOU CAN DO IT,
SPONGEBOB.
你可以做到，
海绵宝宝。

16:27.254 --> 16:29.456
I'LL BE WATCHING.
我会看着的。

16:29.522 --> 16:31.258
THANKS, PAL.
谢谢，朋友。

16:32.292 --> 16:34.061
( rings bell )
（铃声响起）

16:34.094 --> 16:35.062
Hello?
你好？

16:35.128 --> 16:37.197
HIYA, SANDY.
IT'S ME, SPONGEBOB.
你好，桑迪。
是我，海绵宝宝。

16:37.264 --> 16:39.066
Hold on,
I'll let you in.
坚持住，
我会让你进来的。

16:39.066 --> 16:41.768
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

16:42.635 --> 16:44.637
( whistling )
（吹口哨）

16:48.541 --> 16:49.876
( drain gurgling )
（下水道潺潺声）

16:51.378 --> 16:53.846
( stifled whistling )
（压抑的口哨声）

16:58.985 --> 17:01.288
( yelling ):
SANDY!
（大喊）：
桑迪！

17:01.354 --> 17:02.589
OPEN UP!
打开！

17:02.655 --> 17:04.591
SANDY! SANDY!
沙！沙！

17:07.494 --> 17:09.962
SANDY, SOMETHING'S GONE
TERRIBLY WRONG.
桑迪，有东西不见了
非常错误。

17:10.097 --> 17:12.532
THERE'S NO WATER IN...
里面没有水了...

17:14.534 --> 17:16.436
HERE.
这里。

17:16.503 --> 17:19.439
'COURSE THERE'S NO WATER.
当然没有水。

17:19.506 --> 17:20.973
NOTHING BUT AIR.
除了空气什么都没有。

17:26.646 --> 17:27.580
NO WATER?
没有水？

17:27.647 --> 17:29.349
THAT AIN'T A PROBLEM,
IS IT?
这不是问题，
是吗？

17:29.416 --> 17:30.483
( karate yells )
（空手道大喊）

17:31.484 --> 17:32.419
PROBLEM?
问题？

17:32.485 --> 17:35.122
( karate yells )
（空手道大喊）

17:35.122 --> 17:36.689
THAT'S HOW I LIKE
MY AIR.
这就是我喜欢的方式
我的空气。

17:36.756 --> 17:38.024
( inhales deeply )
（深吸一口气）

17:39.025 --> 17:42.129
( gagging, coughing )
（作呕、咳嗽）

17:43.830 --> 17:45.898
WITH NO WATER.
没有水。

17:45.965 --> 17:47.334
Sandy:
WELL, ALL RIGHT.
桑迪：
好吧，好吧。

17:47.400 --> 17:49.269
I MADE TEXAS TEA AND COOKIES.
我做了德克萨斯茶和饼干。

17:49.336 --> 17:50.437
WELL, COME ON IN.
好吧，进来吧。

17:50.503 --> 17:51.571
( karate yells )
（空手道大喊）

17:52.639 --> 17:53.973
( legs squeaking )
（腿吱吱作响）

17:54.040 --> 17:56.143
THAT'S NOT IN.
那不在。

17:56.209 --> 17:57.144
IN!
在！

17:57.210 --> 17:59.479
( squeaking... )
（吱吱声……）

17:59.546 --> 18:01.381
YOU'RE A FUNNY LITTLE DUDE.
你是个有趣的小家伙。

18:01.448 --> 18:03.950
COME ON, I'LL GIVE YOU
THE GRAND TOUR.
来吧，我给你
盛大旅行。

18:05.252 --> 18:08.488
SO THIS IS MY OWN
PRIVATE LITTLE
AIR BUBBLE.
所以这是我自己的
私人小
气泡。

18:08.555 --> 18:10.757
THIS AIR
IS THE DRIEST...
这空气
是最干燥的...

18:10.823 --> 18:12.058
( gasps )
（喘气）

18:12.159 --> 18:13.059
PUREST...
最纯粹...

18:13.160 --> 18:14.161
( gasps )
（喘气）

18:14.194 --> 18:17.197
MOST AIRIEST AIR
IN THE WHOLE SEA.
最通风的空气
在整个大海中。

18:17.264 --> 18:19.266
OH, OVER THERE
IS MY BIRDBATH.
哦，在那儿
是我的水盆。

18:19.332 --> 18:21.201
( chirping cheerily )
（欢快地叽叽喳喳）

18:21.268 --> 18:22.835
AND THAT'S MY
OAK TREE.
这就是我的
橡树。

18:22.902 --> 18:25.405
IT PROVIDES ME
WITH EXTRA AIR.
它为我提供
与额外的空气。

18:26.706 --> 18:29.742
THIS DOME IS MADE OF THE
STRONGEST POLYURETHANE;
这个圆顶是由
最强的聚氨酯；

18:29.809 --> 18:31.844
THAT'S A FANCY NAME
FOR PLASTIC.
这是一个很奇特的名字
对于塑料。

18:31.911 --> 18:33.780
AIN'T THAT JUST
THE BEE'S KNEES?
不是吗？
蜜蜂的膝盖？

18:33.846 --> 18:37.016
TELL YOU WHAT, WEREN'T EASY
GETTING HERE NEITHER.
告诉你，这并不容易
到这里都没有。

18:37.083 --> 18:38.918
FIRST, I HAD
TO HITCH IT UP
TO A BIG, OLD...
首先，我有
连接起来
给一个又大又老的...

18:38.985 --> 18:40.987
( grunting )
（咕哝）

18:41.053 --> 18:43.089
( chirping angrily )
（愤怒地叽叽喳喳）

18:43.190 --> 18:44.824
...THAT'S MY TREADMILL.
...那是我的跑步机。

18:44.891 --> 18:47.294
THAT'S HOW I STAY
IN TIPTOP SHAPE.
这就是我留下来的方式
尖顶形状。

18:47.360 --> 18:48.295
OH, COME ON.
哦，来吧。

18:48.361 --> 18:50.029
LET'S HAVE THAT
TEA NOW.
让我们来吧
现在喝茶。

18:50.096 --> 18:51.264
( karate yells )
（空手道大喊）

18:51.331 --> 18:52.265
( gasps )
（喘气）

18:52.332 --> 18:55.001
( knocking on dome )
（敲击穹顶）

18:55.067 --> 18:57.237
PINKY, PINKY!
小指，小指！

19:00.940 --> 19:03.042
( gasps )
（喘气）

19:06.913 --> 19:09.782
I BROUGHT YOU SOME FLOWERS.
我给你带来了一些花。

19:09.849 --> 19:11.751
FOR ME?
为我？

19:11.818 --> 19:13.686
HOW SWEET!
多么甜蜜啊！

19:18.891 --> 19:20.760
YOU OKAY?
你还好吗？

19:20.827 --> 19:22.495
( raspily ):
YES.
（粗暴地）：
是的。

19:22.562 --> 19:24.364
I'M OKAY.
我没事。

19:24.431 --> 19:27.900
YOU KNOW, YOU'RE THE FIRST
SEA CRITTER TO EVER VISIT.
你知道，你是第一个
值得一去的海洋生物。

19:27.967 --> 19:30.737
I CAN'T IMAGINE WHY.
我无法想象为什么。

19:30.803 --> 19:32.639
CAN I GET
YOU ANYTHING?
我可以得到吗
你有什么事吗？

19:32.705 --> 19:35.675
WATER WOULD BE NICE.
水就好了。

19:35.742 --> 19:37.910
I'M GOING TO PUT
THESE IN A VASE.
我要放
这些在花瓶里。

19:37.977 --> 19:40.413
TAKE YOUR TIME.
慢慢来。

19:42.114 --> 19:44.050
( gasping )
（喘气）

19:47.320 --> 19:52.091
I GOT TO GET OUT OF HERE.
我必须离开这里。

19:52.158 --> 19:54.126
Sandy:
I LIKE YOU, SPONGEBOB.
桑迪：
我喜欢你，海绵宝宝。

19:54.261 --> 19:58.164
WE COULD BE TIGHTER THAN BARK
ON A TREE.
我们可以比树皮更紧
在树上。

19:58.265 --> 20:02.068
Patrick:
WHEN IN DOUBT, PINKY OUT.
帕特里克：
如有疑问，请伸出小指。

20:03.670 --> 20:06.239
I DON'T NEED WATER.
我不需要水。

20:06.306 --> 20:08.375
WATER IS FOR QUITTERS.
水是给戒烟者的。

20:08.441 --> 20:10.377
I DON'T NEED IT.
我不需要它。

20:10.443 --> 20:11.978
I DON'T NEED IT.
我不需要它。

20:12.044 --> 20:13.145
I DON'T NEED IT.
我不需要它。

20:13.212 --> 20:16.416
I DON'T NEED IT,
I DON'T NEED IT.
我不需要它，
我不需要它。

20:16.483 --> 20:20.587
WHY, THESE FLOWERS
ARE JUST BEAUTIFUL.
为什么，这些花
很漂亮。

20:20.653 --> 20:22.889
THEY'LL LIVE MUCH, MUCH LONGER
他们会活得更久

20:22.955 --> 20:27.527
IN A VASE FULL
OF ICE-COLD WATER.
装满花瓶
冰水。

20:27.594 --> 20:28.795
SO TELL ME ABOUT YOURSELF.
请介绍一下您自己。

20:28.861 --> 20:32.432
IT MUST BE FASCINATING
BEING A SEA CRITTER.
它一定很迷人
作为海洋生物。

20:35.302 --> 20:36.936
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

20:37.003 --> 20:38.438
( timer dings )
（定时器的声音）

20:38.505 --> 20:40.106
OH, THERE'S THE COOKIES.
哦，这是饼干。

20:40.172 --> 20:41.808
BE RIGHT BACK.
马上回来。

20:46.145 --> 20:47.814
SpongeBob ( thinking ):
I DON'T NEED IT.
海绵宝宝（思考）：
我不需要它。

20:47.880 --> 20:48.981
I DON'T NEED IT.
我不需要它。

20:49.048 --> 20:53.185
I DEFINITELY DON'T NEED IT.
我绝对不需要它。

20:53.252 --> 20:54.854
I DON'T NEED IT.
我不需要它。

20:54.921 --> 20:56.456
I DON'T NEED IT.
我不需要它。

20:56.523 --> 20:57.790
I DON'T NEED IT.
我不需要它。

20:57.857 --> 20:59.392
I DON'T NEED IT.
我不需要它。

21:02.329 --> 21:05.832
( howling ):
I NEED IT!
（嚎叫）：
我需要它！

21:07.334 --> 21:09.602
( wheezing )
（喘息）

21:09.669 --> 21:10.637
NO, SPONGEBOB!
不，海绵宝宝！

21:10.703 --> 21:11.638
NO, NO, NO!
不，不，不！

21:11.704 --> 21:13.239
STOP!
停止！

21:13.340 --> 21:15.742
PINKY, PINKY!
小指，小指！

21:18.845 --> 21:21.714
( yelling ):
I'M A QUITTER!
（大喊）：
我是一个戒烟者！

21:21.781 --> 21:23.550
( SpongeBob wailing )
（海绵宝宝哭泣）

21:27.887 --> 21:29.822
YOU CAN'T LEAVE NOW.
你现在不能离开。

21:29.889 --> 21:30.923
YOU'LL BLOW IT.
你会搞砸的。

21:30.990 --> 21:33.726
AIR IS NOT GOOD, PATRICK.
帕特里克，空气不好。

21:33.793 --> 21:35.928
AIR IS NOT GOOD.
空气不好。

21:35.995 --> 21:40.066
YOU'RE JUST BEING SHY.
你只是害羞了。

21:40.132 --> 21:41.534
DON'T WORRY, BUDDY.
别担心，伙计。

21:41.601 --> 21:43.503
YOU'RE DOING FINE.
你做得很好。

21:43.570 --> 21:45.071
( panting heavily )
（气喘吁吁）

21:45.137 --> 21:47.740
I WON'T LET YOU BLOW... THIS.
我不会让你吹……这个。

21:47.807 --> 21:49.208
( wheezing )
（喘息）

21:50.643 --> 21:51.811
( gagging )
（作呕）

21:57.149 --> 22:01.187
WHAT KIND OF PLACE IS THIS?!
这是什么地方？！

22:01.388 --> 22:04.290
THERE'S NO WATER IN HERE!
这里没有水！

22:04.391 --> 22:06.626
I TRIED
TO TELL YOU.
我尝试过
告诉你。

22:06.693 --> 22:10.029
WE GOT TO GET
OUT OF HERE!
我们必须得到
离开这里！

22:10.096 --> 22:13.165
YOU'RE DOING IT WRONG.
你做错了。

22:13.232 --> 22:16.669
WAIT, NO,
WE'VE GOT TO GET OUT.
等等，不，
我们必须出去。

22:16.736 --> 22:19.238
( door opens, closes )
（门打开、关闭）

22:19.305 --> 22:20.440
COME AND GET IT.
快过来取。

22:20.507 --> 22:22.809
YOU'RE ALL GOING TO LIKE THIS--
你们都会喜欢这个——

22:22.875 --> 22:23.843
( shrieks )
（尖叫声）

22:23.910 --> 22:27.414
( glasses breaking )
（眼镜碎了）

22:31.451 --> 22:32.419
THERE.
那里。

22:32.452 --> 22:33.720
THAT OUGHT TO DO IT.
应该这样做。

22:33.786 --> 22:38.825
IF YOU ALL NEEDED WATER,
YOU SHOULD HAVE ASKED.
如果你们都需要水，
你应该问一下。

22:38.891 --> 22:40.693
I PROPOSE A TOAST:
我提议干杯：

22:40.760 --> 22:43.329
TO NEW FRIENDS!
致新朋友！

22:47.133 --> 22:48.435
HOLD ON A SECOND.
请稍等。

22:48.501 --> 22:51.337
I HOPE YOU ALL LIKE
YOUR TEA STRONG.
我希望你们都喜欢
你的茶很浓。

22:51.438 --> 22:54.040
DRINK UP!
喝吧！

22:56.308 --> 22:58.445
( both slurping )
（两人都发出咕噜声）

22:58.511 --> 23:01.881
All:
AH!
全部：
啊！

23:07.454 --> 23:11.123
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

